common_form	one
excess	one
alike	one
equal	one
# common_form: S3 allows a form shared unequally, as air shares heat with fire, while S4 speaks of the same nature in Father and Son.
# I read S4 as applying S3's general notion to a case, not as a second sense, because both are true when the two share a form.
